## Purpose
Prefer configured numeric notice days across equivalent notice-period questions
without exposing the applicant's actual notice period.

## Tasks
- [x] Prefer the dedicated numeric value for every supported notice phrasing.
- [x] Parse the first integer from a textual fallback.
- [x] Retain genuinely nonnumeric fallback text only for compatible questions.
- [x] Extend resolver tests and update example comments and user guidance.

## Acceptance criteria
- [x] Historical coverage includes numeric preference and textual/non-numeric fallbacks.
- [x] Returned numeric answers have no appended day label.

